    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Xenofauna</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Haplopelma</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 4–16</p><p>The sciurid is a large, omnivorous, six-legged, flying, squirrellike mammal.They are intelligent and inquisitive, and exhibit behavior such as altruism, laughter, language mimicry, tool use, and targeted hunting.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Limber (Level 1), Small Size (−10 to hit)</p><p><strong>Ware:</strong> Gliding Membrane, Prehensile Tail</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 6 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 5, Death Rating 38.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 160.</em></p>",
